  "about": "Find the broken mod bisects over dependency-closed groups. Nodes: the enabled mods, in load order. An edge joins a mod to each requirement that is also enabled (a requirement that is off is followed through to the enabled mods it needs, since turning a group on turns those on too; a requirement that is not installed adds nothing). Each connected component is one group; members keep load order; groups are ordered by their first member. Both the app (order.ts) and the game (PZMMModScreen.lua K.bisectGroups) must produce exactly these groups.",
